          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini isii eebise, d'aatu gaara kiyya qulqullo, tisse, gannaafi hagayya roobaafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba mukeeni ch'ufti mid'aani baafte, oobruleeni ch'ufti sagale baafte, nami ch'ufti nagayaani fulluma ufi taa. Hojja anini sansalata gumi tiyyaani hid'ani ch'abse worra worra boojie tisse tolfate kaani jalaa baasu, hojja suni worri aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gochiti Waaqa imbeenneleeni itumaa deebite worra haate insaamtu, ammalle bineensi alaalleni itumaa deebie worra nyaate infit'u. Worri nagayumani taa, nami deebie worra mudamsiisu injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa guddo mid'aani baaftu worraa kenne beelale lafa suni keesaa balleesa. Gochiti d'ibileeni deebite worra goyeesite intufattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akanaani nami ch'ufti imbeekha aka anini Israeli qorqorad'u, aka worrileeni gumi tiyya. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
